<LanguageData>

  <!-- EN: Mechanitor Ship -->
  <MechanitorShuttles.label>机械师飞船</MechanitorShuttles.label>
  <!-- EN: Mechanitor ship, recreated using ancient technology, has worse fuel consumption, slightly better recharge time before departure, and greater flight range, though it falls short of the Drone. The main advantage is high cargo capacity and a larger fuel tank. Requires a mechanitor colonist to research. -->
  <MechanitorShuttles.description>机械师飞船用远古技术重新制造。和载客穿梭机相比，它消耗的化合燃料更多，再次发射前等待的时间略短，航程也更远，但航程仍不如太空无人机。它的主要优点是载货量大，燃料箱也更大。研究这项科技需要殖民地里有一名机械师。</MechanitorShuttles.description>

</LanguageData>
